  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Swooping down on your foe, you unleash a furious avian barrage.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Base attack bonus +1, suqur.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using the charge action to attack with a manufactured or veil weapon while flying, you may also make a single free attack with each of your talons as part of the charge (these are treated as secondary natural attacks). In addition, your falcon blood racial trait may now be invested with essence, increasing the bonus to Fly and Perception checks by +1 per point of essence invested.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
